    (268948, 'hw2Z9dfAYa06UDzQkOi7gg', 'ed5PO9jGfdaOjKcE0Kqb1A', 'Warning: must prepay 2 months of fees when you cancel. No returns/ exchanges on products- not posted in store. Nice ladies, stupid policies.', '2011-04-26', 0),
    (269417, 'ZBoS5psMODvIrpMNn7SCtw', 'PKgCEXceBliLXsm3vQjfWA', 'I''m openly gay and never had an issue with this place.  I have been going there for over a year and every time I need a cut they are ready to hook me up.  I can openly talk about who I am and not feel like I''m being judged or discriminated on.  They do not discriminate against the gay community at all. I know a couple of the barbers outside of the shop and know they are not ''anti-gay''.  Its a great place, they have a good team and they know their trade.  Props to Sr''s Barbershop!', '2013-05-30', 0),
    (269418, 'ZBoS5psMODvIrpMNn7SCtw', 'r9_tXmlmmm1OTtEzezcnRQ', 'Yolanda is the Best!', '2011-08-29', 0),
    (269463, 'ORPFMdzXiIhxATWTJc2-4w', '26wW6FNWdmC23Vz-sjy9Dw', 'Might try surf n turf lol....sampled it and did not like at all', '2013-04-17', 0),
    (269464, 'ORPFMdzXiIhxATWTJc2-4w', '1FyKFP7FoEau88dcKoHj6Q', 'Food is good. But you have to get it to go. They do not use A/C. It was 115 outside,  but it felt hotter inside. I asked the cashier if the A/C was broken but she just giggled and said, " I don''t know". People were changing their order to togo mid order because of the heat.', '2013-06-28', 0),
    (269465, 'ORPFMdzXiIhxATWTJc2-4w', '_rg8SIAg4w2_CsVJNlm7Uw', 'I asked for original fried rice instead I got brown fried rice. Aka gross sticky and disgusting.', '2013-07-30', 0),
