    (280164, 'NcXkPZKc6PJQYb9hOcTMJw', 'MQiH2r_YcOvDVjRORz01Dg', 'Our new favorite spot for some fast fresh Mexican food. Had the shrimp burrito fish tacos rice and beans plate was delicious and hot.', '2012-10-07', 1),
