    (280166, 'NcXkPZKc6PJQYb9hOcTMJw', '2li317oUeXfPNjyPAvm6wg', 'This was our first time here, used the drive thru. I read other reviews saying it was expensive but I thought we got a lot of food for the price. I just got the carne asada burrito and I couldn''t finish it. My boyfriend got a breakfast burrito and my son got the quesadilla kids meal, no complaints!', '2013-02-19', 0),
    (280167, 'NcXkPZKc6PJQYb9hOcTMJw', '2li317oUeXfPNjyPAvm6wg', 'The drive thru takes a little bit so it might be better going in instead of waiting behind other cars. Food was awesome and definitely worth waiting for.', '2013-02-19', 0),
