    (280169, 'NcXkPZKc6PJQYb9hOcTMJw', '2li317oUeXfPNjyPAvm6wg', 'I got a cheese enchilada here and the cheese inside isn''t melted at all! It''s not even warm, so disappointed cause I love this place.', '2013-05-11', 0),
    (280170, 'NcXkPZKc6PJQYb9hOcTMJw', 'jzV4F-76GqoJKBtBrRFN0w', 'I love this fast food Mexican restaurant. You know it''s good because not only are its employees all Latinos, but the customers are too! It''s like if you go to an Italian place and see the Sopranos, you know the food''s gonna be good.  Don''t expect Taco Bell speed or prices though because everything is made upon ordering, but that''s the cost of better food.  I recommend the Shrimp taco or if you like spicy the Diablo Shrimp Burrito.', '2013-06-13', 0),
