    (280180, 'NcXkPZKc6PJQYb9hOcTMJw', 'B9_u34o_iG_vbIW2suFlQg', 'This food is more authentic than your typical sit down Mexican food restaurant. They take great care in providing quality meat for their burritos and the salsa bar is truly outstanding. Many moons ago when I first started coming here, the only thing that could be said about this place that was not positive was the beans that they use in their food we''re heavy and very pasty. It''s been at least a year now that they have fixed that and their beans are outstanding just like the rest of their menu.', '2014-02-16', 0),
